{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_title", "source_sha256": "570e9c062c05c1866b75d5897601de6accc9a27b1081886617d0503ca778ba0b", "ja": "あの光のように", "zh": "如同那道光一样", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8f6544ec94885d24191b73e40b4fffc47c29dcfcf3f261e129dd3f24e79ca70d", "ja": "新曲のレッスンを頑張る約束で、翼はプロデ\nューサーとデートする。みんなが眩しいと語\nる翼のため、プロデューサーはメンバーに、\nメインを食うつもりでやってくれと提案。そ\nして公演当日、翼は誰よりも輝くのだった。", "zh": "翼以努力练习新歌为约定，和制作人\n去约会。为了觉得大家都很耀眼的翼，\n制作人向成员们提议，让他们抱着抢走\n主角风头的势头去表演。随后在公演当天，\n翼绽放出了比任何人都更加耀眼的光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e91d46b1f15cff1e69241c3d5cb05f486d6193566cb885425008cb9839414dc5", "ja": "（翼の新曲披露公演が無事に終わった。\nお客さん達の歓声が鳴り止まないな……）", "zh": "（翼的新歌发布公演顺利结束了。客人们的欢呼声一直没有停下来啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4627dbabc6ab9787449a79e8ca63edfa34ffdefc6671c1a79f93e8c1189d73d7", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0aeaded3c0b39877fc028bd22c039fb2006003a7cb82dce6eddf7284673abc2b", "ja": "わたしの新曲、どうでしたか？\nちゃんとできてましたよね！？", "zh": "我的新歌怎么样？\n我表现得很棒吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1003_p", "source_sha256": "94510cbc49bcd29c23c37e59a27368a1937a4aa954d95a8120cfb8e7c398a58e", "ja": "お疲れさま、翼。\n思わず見とれちゃうぐらい、いいステージだったよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，翼。\n那是一场精彩到让人不知不觉看入迷的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "00c6becfc7297650e061181f0ac19b7db38d35e303e48d49896cad923d3bfd60", "ja": "わ～い！　ありがとうございまーす！\nすっごくがんばったもんね♪", "zh": "哇～！谢谢大家——！\n我可是超级努力了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "65f03afa96467916cfe1091d1727018003d2d47719370614d8c8198344970bf0", "ja": "せっかく、わたしがもらった新曲なのに。\nみんなに負けちゃったら、カッコ悪いし！", "zh": "难得是我拿到的新歌。\n要是输给大家了，那可就太丢脸了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "455cd49d35c546cc9fdfafc690bed2a3bd63e13964a39557a37bdd2af985f5f6", "ja": "……ねえ、{$P$}さん。\n今日はわたしが一番、キラキラしてましたよね？", "zh": "……我说，{$P$}先生。\n今天是我最闪闪发光了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8ec29d7d7341ae87323a1fb4f1c931be2519d2c9badda3136c58d30f6c54f50e", "ja": "……ああ。今日は翼が一番、眩しかった。", "zh": "……啊啊。今天翼确实是最耀眼的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "877291d9c77d4a56b79b9a277a215fc0131c509304877598371b4a3bf84ef4c8", "ja": "やった～！！　えへへっ、よかった♪", "zh": "太棒了～！！　嘿嘿，太好啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "4b0c02d1770108ab5c9d77f14e6eeb44b4612cc46134a1e6307b9e4f3338393f", "ja": "翼、お疲れー！　すごくカッコよかったな！\nなんかオレ、ビックリしちゃったよ。", "zh": "翼，辛苦啦！刚才帅呆了！我都不由得吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "55317ab8624ba1358287694552bbd4a2405699ba114f5f9913d4b094f8b3fad7", "ja": "ええ。ステージから飛び出していきそうな、\nそんな勢いで……。追いかけるのに必死でした。", "zh": "是啊。那股气势简直像要从舞台上冲出去一样……我拼命才追得上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "2f96716eb552312c1d9e0c7206cfd27c4096c34c9e6482287c0426b373ae84f0", "ja": "自分は全然負けてなかったと思うけど……でも、\n今日のMVPは、翼に譲ろうかな！　ね、美希？", "zh": "我觉得自己完全没有输……不过，\n今天的MVP就让给翼吧！对吧，美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "c712d1399c285365d8fb4d4b0a067255fc599389965a85de069b41652d68f057", "ja": "ミキも負けてないって思うけど。\nでもお客さんは、翼を待ってるみたいだね。", "zh": "我也觉得自己完全没有输。\n不过客人们好像都在等着翼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1014_audience", "source_sha256": "f0505579cb5f3b2480ff0a0479309ebf5f27f5f64584b1961ceb624575ad5934", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a8f06d0fa8c74c84108ea3a377388096315872d411063e8cc2dd4656ff2203fb", "ja": "そうだな。\nそれじゃ、あの声援に応えようか。……翼！", "zh": "是啊。\n那就回应大家的声援吧。……翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1ab79803da2db1674e3709a3b6e2bddda51ff02ea43523ce5020ce6a884c9a81", "ja": "は～い！\nみんな、アンコールの準備はいいですか？", "zh": "好——！大家，准备好返场了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c", "ja": "ああ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "9c1ec5e6eb430f0be966a9886391f3e0dfeb44f0e8a64ac1af17cc806edc419c", "ja": "うんっ！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "97bb18c9ee6664e600d49ac23202a01795b71111f7ce57d41fdf09410eb5bc5b", "ja": "はいなの♪", "zh": "好～的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9e5d95d465f33e458a5d61015ff236ee8921c0ac087a71d990c338e437f0532f", "ja": "あっ……美希ちゃん、ちょっと待って！", "zh": "啊……美希，等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "9249f525333d2601d10d2b3f01763b5dea4520a0672bcb2eb97572e07929a24d", "ja": "？　どうしたの、翼？", "zh": "？怎么了，翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7904e58284097a4394482aceda8b439b87be2aa4591a74d160341d488cc94ae9", "ja": "えっと……あのね。ありがとう！", "zh": "那个……谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b45bfbbf86570daac4bf9b3740ee4c0ec25fed197b8b1455e7ee1f9244a24a5b", "ja": "前にバックダンサーした時にね。わたし、美希ちゃんの\n言ってることが、よくわからなかったんだけど……。", "zh": "之前当伴舞的时候，我其实没太明白美希在说什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d1ea5dfd83d5e92300576fa02b1bfb8e6e4d13aaa5144b58092fdbcd52001849", "ja": "でも今日……。こういうことなのかなって。\n今、すごく楽しいかもって、ちょっと思っちゃった！", "zh": "不过今天……我突然觉得，或许就是这种感觉吧。现在好像特别开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "7ffc7ef729b022df7d5f509dfe3964d823516d18e8dc93fccaaed9092702c601", "ja": "翼……？", "zh": "翼……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "988be3b1ab1b3266ef2127b3f277953fc34df90bbf6cab303b965f2ac75577ff", "ja": "だから、えっと……これからも、\nよろしくお願いしますね！　美希先輩♪", "zh": "所以，那个……今后也请多多关照啦！美希前辈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "3798c1b971b8f36156beee81bae6da490f08028979418449fb8fb33f9a4e8f42", "ja": "……。\nヤ！　よろしくしてあげないの。", "zh": "……。\n才不要！美希才不关照你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "384e1b6e774029c79240e0bee741b8cba6c25dbcaf3c9de3aec1c0fdd7fe0d13", "ja": "えええええ～っ！？", "zh": "诶诶诶诶诶～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "5c8695716402388c97fa276bd0759b025be9682d96bc3e47cbded03d626b2beb", "ja": "だってミキ、もう負けたくないし。……あはっ♪\nそれじゃ、お先に失礼なの～！", "zh": "因为美希已经不想再输了嘛。……啊哈♪\n那么，美希就先走一步咯～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "60ee954cb3187a2099d91c3c239ae4865d53e319588781975a73bc9b96718c39", "ja": "あっ、待ってくださいよ～！\n美希先輩～！", "zh": "啊，等等我啦～！\n美希前辈～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a8987c7b06e956f307ba2f94237c3bc1eb93fb6ee6d0df0f45591d4dd52792fa", "ja": "（翼は、前に進むための『翼』を手に入れた。\nこれからは、もっと高みへと飛んでいけるだろう）", "zh": "（翼得到了向前迈进的“翅膀”。今后应该能飞向更高的地方吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_056_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_056_1034_p", "source_sha256": "f314656bea56b707a126169309f0b8ed58bd53b792bfaced9f0457ba0bb86929", "ja": "（アイドル達は、目指した輝きを追いかけ続ける。\n自分だけの輝きを信じて……！）", "zh": "（偶像们继续追逐着那道向往的光芒。\n相信只属于自己的光芒……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
